                        "entry_id": "fbf8e028-1034-3275-8487-e098be5aacaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Without blinking; firmly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb2d8b78-c4e7-4209-9ea6-6efc0acbecfd",
                                "sense_id": "684657aa-1f59-3895-84d5-6cabcaf55957",
                                "text": "Unblinkingly the girl kept her first vigil."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28964c63-c862-4de8-8a88-deb6644feb41",
                                "sense_id": "684657aa-1f59-3895-84d5-6cabcaf55957",
                                "text": "She stood this inspection unblinkingly, incapable of the little insincerities of self-consciousness, but when it was over, and Bradly had resumed his normal face, she gave a relieved wriggle, as if satisfied by an ordeal which obviously satisfied Bradly, for he said with approval, \"Comes well, that hat; paint you in that hat; picks up reflected lights a treat, that hat.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d41e3858-8f81-4f9a-a425-2a121ef854e7",
                                "sense_id": "684657aa-1f59-3895-84d5-6cabcaf55957",
                                "text": "To restore investor confidence, Lula installed an unblinkingly orthodox economic team at the Central Bank and Ministry of Finance, which hiked interest rates yet further and cut public investment, to achieve a primary fiscal surplus higher even than the figure the IMF had demanded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f908ef3-f912-4ca5-904f-3aec12d39cf2",
                                "sense_id": "684657aa-1f59-3895-84d5-6cabcaf55957",
                                "text": "In the sprawling Reddit community r/collapse, people instead try to stare unblinkingly at the unravelling of civilization."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
